{"seq":1,"slug":"input-replay-recording","title":"输入回放与录制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/replay-lockstep/input-replay-recording","wordCount":1439,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"输入回放与录制\">输入回放与录制</h1><p>《魔兽争霸 III》一场一小时的对局，回放文件只有几百 KB；同样长度若逐帧存画面或全量状态，要几十 GB。这个上千倍的差距来自一个朴素事实：在确定性模拟里，状态是输入的纯函数，所以录制一场对局不必录状态，只需录「初始种子 + 每帧输入」，回放时本地重跑模拟逐帧重建。这一篇讲这套「输入即回放」的格式与机制——它是确定性最直接的兑现，也是锁步与回滚的数据基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>回放系统建立在 hub 中轴公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>…</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_n = f(\\dots f(f(S_0, I_0), I_1)\\dots, I_{n-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 之上。录制阶段持久化的不是状态序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0, S_1, \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span>，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(S_0, I_0, I_1, \\dots, I_{n-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——一个初始状态加一条输入流。回放阶段从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 出发，喂入记录的输入流，本地重跑那台确定性机器，逐帧重建出与原局逐字节相同的每一帧。下图对比「状态录制」与「输入录制」两条路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一场对局] --&gt; B[状态录制&lt;br/&gt;每帧存全量 S_t]&#10;  A --&gt; C[输入录制&lt;br/&gt;存 S_0 + 输入流]&#10;  B --&gt; D[体积巨大&lt;br/&gt;几十 GB]&#10;  C --&gt; E[体积极小&lt;br/&gt;几十 KB]&#10;  C --&gt; F[回放=本地重跑 f]&#10;  F --&gt; G{依赖确定性}&#10;  G --&gt;|模拟确定| H[逐帧精确重建]&#10;  G --&gt;|模拟不确定| I[从某帧起分叉]\">flowchart TD\n  A[一场对局] --&gt; B[状态录制&lt;br/&gt;每帧存全量 S_t]\n  A --&gt; C[输入录制&lt;br/&gt;存 S_0 + 输入流]\n  B --&gt; D[体积巨大&lt;br/&gt;几十 GB]\n  C --&gt; E[体积极小&lt;br/&gt;几十 KB]\n  C --&gt; F[回放=本地重跑 f]\n  F --&gt; G{依赖确定性}\n  G --&gt;|模拟确定| H[逐帧精确重建]\n  G --&gt;|模拟不确定| I[从某帧起分叉]</pre><p>下表对比两种录制范式的取舍——输入录制的省空间是用「强确定性依赖」换来的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>状态录制</th>\n<th>输入录制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文件体积</td>\n<td>极大（正比于状态×帧数）</td>\n<td>极小（正比于输入×帧数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对确定性依赖</td>\n<td>无（直接回放状态）</td>\n<td>强（任何不确定即分叉）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跳转任意帧</td>\n<td>直接读该帧</td>\n<td>需从最近检查点重跑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本兼容</td>\n<td>状态格式变即失效</td>\n<td>逻辑改一行即可能分叉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>视频录制、调试快照</td>\n<td>RTS/格斗回放、锁步联机</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"录制-到底要存什么\">录制：到底要存什么</h2><p>输入录制要存三样。其一，初始状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的完整描述——地图、双方阵营、初始单位布局，以及随机数种子（见 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/rng-determinism\">随机数确定性</a>，种子是初始状态的一部分）。其二，逐 tick 的输入流：每个固定 tick（不是渲染帧，见 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/deterministic-update-loop\">确定性更新循环</a>）每个玩家的指令，多数 tick 玩家什么都没按，所以输入流高度稀疏、极度可压。其三，版本标识：模拟逻辑的版本号或代码哈希，回放时若版本不符就拒绝或警告——因为逻辑改一行就可能让旧输入流从某帧起重建出不同结果。注意「输入」要是逻辑层指令（「移动单位 A 到坐标 X」），而非原始硬件事件（「鼠标在屏幕 320,240 按下」），后者还依赖分辨率、UI 布局等不该进入模拟的状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回放-本地重跑而非播放\">回放：本地重跑而非播放</h2><p>回放不是「播放一段录像」，而是「把记录的输入重新喂给模拟内核跑一遍」。这带来几个独特能力：可以暂停、变速、自由切换观察视角（因为每帧状态都被真实重建出来，不是预渲染的画面）；可以在回放中开启调试可视化，因为模拟是活的。但也带来约束：回放必须用与录制时逐位一致的模拟代码，否则会分叉——这把「确定性测试」推到关键位置（见 <a href=\"../practice/determinism-testing\">确定性测试</a>，CI 要保证新提交不破坏旧回放）。回放的正确性其实是确定性的最佳试金石：如果一段回放能逐帧重现，说明那段模拟是确定的；如果回放与原局对不上，说明藏着非确定性来源——这也是 desync 调试的基础手段（见 <a href=\"../practice/desync-debugging\">不同步调试</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检查点-让回放能随机跳转\">检查点：让回放能随机跳转</h2><p>纯输入录制有个弱点：要看第 50000 帧，得从第 0 帧重跑五万步。解法是周期性写「检查点」——每隔 N 帧把完整状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{kN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 快照一次（这部分是状态序列化，与 <a href=\"../../game-save-serialization/\">存档兄弟 hub</a> 同源）。跳转到任意帧时，从最近的检查点恢复状态，再重跑剩余的几帧即可，把「五万步」降到「几百步」。检查点还是回滚网络的近亲——回滚就是高频地保存近几帧状态以便回退（见 <a href=\"rollback-netcode\">回滚网络</a>）。检查点频率是空间与跳转速度的权衡：越密跳转越快但文件越大，常见做法是每几秒一个检查点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容错与防篡改\">容错与防篡改</h2><p>回放是要长期保存、跨版本分享、甚至作为比赛证据的，因此要管两件事。其一，版本与兼容：回放头里记录引擎版本、内容版本、平台，回放前校验，不兼容时给出明确提示而非静默分叉。其二，完整性：给回放（尤其检查点）附校验和，既能检测文件损坏，也能识别篡改——有人若手改了输入流试图伪造一场不可能的对局，重跑出的状态校验和会对不上。压缩、去重与存储布局的细节由 <a href=\"../practice/replay-compression-storage\">回放压缩与存储</a> 专门展开，本篇只确立数据模型：种子 + 稀疏输入流 + 周期检查点 + 版本头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>输入录制只存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（含种子）+ 逐 tick 稀疏输入流，回放=本地重跑确定性模拟，体积比状态录制小上千倍。</li>\n<li>录的是逻辑层指令而非原始硬件事件，并带版本标识防止跨逻辑版本分叉。</li>\n<li>回放是「活的重跑」，支持暂停/变速/换视角，也是检验确定性的最佳试金石。</li>\n<li>周期检查点让回放可随机跳转，并与回滚的状态保存同源；校验和兼顾损坏检测与防篡改。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../deterministic-sim/rng-determinism\">随机数确定性</a>——种子为何必须随回放一起存。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/replay-compression-storage\">回放压缩与存储</a>——稀疏输入流如何进一步压缩与保管。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-save-serialization/techniques/snapshot-vs-delta\">存档与序列化 · 快照与增量</a>——检查点用到的状态快照技术。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"输入回放与录制","id":"输入回放与录制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"录制：到底要存什么","id":"录制-到底要存什么"},{"level":2,"text":"回放：本地重跑而非播放","id":"回放-本地重跑而非播放"},{"level":2,"text":"检查点：让回放能随机跳转","id":"检查点-让回放能随机跳转"},{"level":2,"text":"容错与防篡改","id":"容错与防篡改"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"随机数确定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/deterministic-sim/rng-determinism"},"next":{"title":"锁步联机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/replay-lockstep/lockstep-networking"}}